OL,3,GNEWSAFerry regulation risks
OL,4,Asustainability, boss warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of a cross-Solent ferry
OL,7,Foperator has cautioned that regulating
OL,8,Fservices could put "the sustainability
OL,9,Fof the business at risk".
OL,11,FEarlier this week Prime Minister Andy
OL,12,FBurnham said he would "look seriously"
OL,13,Fat any proposal to limit fares on
OL,14,Fcrossings to and from the Isle of
OL,15,FWight.
OL,17,FFares, timetables and the reliability
OL,18,Fof crossings have been a source of
OL,19,Ffrustration among both island residents
OL,20,Fand visitors.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
