OL,3,GNEWSAFerry regulation risks
OL,4,Asustainability, boss warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FWightlink chief executive Katie Taylor
OL,7,Ftold the BBC it ran a "really extensive
OL,8,Ftimetable" by subsidising loss-making
OL,9,Fcrossings with heavily-used services.
